# The SFX bank is a build product: tools/gen_sfx.py regenerates it
# byte-for-byte from integer arithmetic, and docs/audio-provenance.json
# is the artifact of record that `make check-sfx` gates against. The
# WAVs themselves would be 600 KB of binary that git cannot diff and
# that the manifest already pins.
assets/sfx/*.wav
